<tr><td style="padding:0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">1. Name the rule that applies before the task, in one line.<br>2. Command output goes in verbatim. Too long means a file path, never a trim.<br>3. No &quot;passed&quot;, &quot;exists&quot; or &quot;removed&quot; without the output in the same reply.<br>4. Check the audience before any cloud or publish action.<br>5. Before /handoff or /clear: this page. What shipped, what is open, every prompt with its answer and a note.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr>
